      "root_admission_required": true,
      "source_boundary_note": "The complete original Theorem 1.1(4) clause is retained, with both source branches and their author proof; only the existing stable nonadmissible-triple task is counted. The complete new genus-two cyclicity/Vandermonde argument, cyclic-vacuum commutant injection, graph intersection and swapping operator are included. The selected branch uses the explicitly printed first case of Lemma 4.4; the other greater-than-37 branch and its explicit polynomial calculation are retained as uncounted original context. Established WRT skein/fusion bases and Weil decomposition remain author-cited prerequisites. Original author macros and graph diagrams are retained.",
